flowchart TD
  R["Root: the problem"] --> SE["Select a leaf<br/>by UCT"]
  SE --> EX["Expand: the LLM proposes<br/>K next thoughts or actions"]
  EX --> EV["Evaluate: LLM scores each<br/>or roll out to the end"]
  EV --> BP["Backpropagate the value<br/>up the tree"]
  BP --> SE
  EV -->|"failure"| RF["Reflect (LATS)<br/>and store the lesson"]
  RF --> SE
  BP --> B["Best path = answer"]
